        // but here feeRate is 0 so initialize should succeed. We now assert the invariant that on success baseToken() equals the provided _baseToken.
        // This is a single assertion reading c's public getter which the correct contract always satisfies; the mutant fails for some fuzzed _baseToken/_nft.
        if (ok) {
